# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Customer artwork. NEVER published.
#
# _inbox/ is Tyler's drop zone for new customer images - failures to work on,
# jobs to test. Transient: images move out to _scripts/corpus/ if they become
# calibration material, or are deleted once the job is done. See _inbox/README.md.
#
# The bare /*.png etc. rules are a SAFETY NET, not the intended path. Tyler
# drops images in the project root by habit (twice on 2026-09-07), and a
# customer logo reaching the public repo is the one unrecoverable mistake this
# project can make. Belt and braces on purpose.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
_inbox/
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.webp
/*.bmp
